An automated pipeline for regional mapping. To identify a comprhensive list of businesses with physical presences in certain areas, to allow people looking for various IT related jobs to use the list as they would like to search for jobs, rather than relying on postings. The underlying assumption being that all businesses identified programatically can reasonably be assumed to have some sort of data flow, compute and management infrastructure, allowing those seeking IT work to inquire into how those IT systems are handled and see what kind of work opportunities are posted/or not.
